  231|       |            // https://zips.z.cash/protocol/protocol.pdf#concretesym but fixed to
  232|       |            // 580 bytes in https://zips.z.cash/protocol/protocol.pdf#outputencodingandconsensus
  233|       |            // See [`note::EncryptedNote::zcash_deserialize`].
